{"id":"n62085-1-7","stage":1,"title":"메다 · 背","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62085-1-7-1","ko":"학교도 끝났는데 책가방 메고 어디를 가니?","zh":"学校都放学了，还背着书包要去哪儿？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"학교도","meaning":"学校","explanation":"학교：学校；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"학교","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73276","senseId":"1","lemma":"학교","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"끝났는데","meaning":"下课，下班","explanation":"끝나다：下课，下班；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"끝나다","audio":"/audio/80a25f4e1416ded1f122.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34734","senseId":"4","lemma":"끝나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"책가방","meaning":"书包","explanation":"책가방：书包","readings":[{"term":"책가방","audio":"/audio/b89516dddcb516503555.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72037","senseId":"1","lemma":"책가방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"메고","meaning":"背，扛","explanation":"메다：背，扛；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"메다","audio":"/audio/7df1a991b810512557dd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62085","senseId":"1","lemma":"메다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어디를","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가니?","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"f7b9c878ccca829a","term":"학교","zh":"学校","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3","entryId":"73276","definition":"按照一定的目标、教育课程、制度等，教师对学生进行教育的机构。","pronunciation":["학꾜"]},{"id":"80a25f4e1416ded1","term":"끝나다","zh":"下课，下班","audio":"/audio/80a25f4e1416ded1f122.mp3","entryId":"34734","definition":"在学校或公司等地方做完当天的功课或业务。","pronunciation":["끈나다"]},{"id":"b89516dddcb51650","term":"책가방","zh":"书包","audio":"/audio/b89516dddcb516503555.mp3","entryId":"72037","definition":"主要指学生提或背的包，用于放书、本子或笔袋等。","pronunciation":["책까방"]},{"id":"7df1a991b8105125","term":"메다","zh":"背，扛","audio":"/audio/7df1a991b810512557dd.mp3","entryId":"62085","definition":"把物体放在肩膀或背上。","pronunciation":["메ː다"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"从一个地方移动到另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/381ea8e3ff27f150c10f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62085-1-7-2","ko":"학원에 가야 돼.","zh":"我得去补习班。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"학원에","meaning":"补习班，培训班","explanation":"학원：补习班，培训班；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"학원","audio":"/audio/a34f3f1b2a44f15f7e22.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72425","senseId":"2","lemma":"학원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가야","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돼.","meaning":"应该、必须（-아/어야 되다）","explanation":"되다：应该、必须（-아/어야 되다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"18","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"a34f3f1b2a44f15f","term":"학원","zh":"补习班，培训班","audio":"/audio/a34f3f1b2a44f15f7e22.mp3","entryId":"72425","definition":"招收学生并教授其知识、技术及艺术体育等的私立教育机关。","pronunciation":["하권"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"应该、必须（-아/어야 되다）","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"应该、必须（-아/어야 되다）","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5f4aa7d0409ff480041c.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.113,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62085","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":39,"sequenceScore":1.8383,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我得去补习班。","敏俊最近怎么这么辛苦啊？","学校都放学了，还背着书包要去哪儿？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我得去补习班。","学校都放学了，还背着书包要去哪儿？","敏俊最近怎么这么辛苦啊？"],"answer":0}]}
